OL,3,AFrance halts use of stun grenades after
OL,4,Aboy's hand blown off in student
OL,5,Aprotests
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe disruption continued on Wednesday
OL,8,Fwith more than 500 schools fully or
OL,9,Fpartially shut, and Prime Minister
OL,10,FSebastien Lecornu is due to speak about
OL,11,Fthe school protests in an evening
OL,12,Faddress.
